WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Held heavy punch and heavy Flash Chop begin against cornered Ryu.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.400
Standing jab cancels into the actual OD quarter-circle-forward punch and Level 2.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.900
Raw Rush crouching heavy punch picks up the corner rebound before medium Flash Axe.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.450
Prowler medium punch into heavy Knee Smash finishes the full route.
